            "review_text": "SunrayForest\nAsia20 contributions\n0\nGOOD FOOD BUT NOT WORTH TRYING AGAIN!\nJun 2018 • Friends\nAfter having had a tour around Saigon, I went there to have dinner with Vietnamese locals. I ordered a special version of Vietnamese Steamed Rice Rolls which had egg, pork meat, tiny shrimp, mushroom inside. \n\nAbout the food: It tasted good but I soon feel sated with the dish after finishing eating it. \n\nAbout the service: Waiters and waitresses served quite quickly and they did serve me the fresh and hot dish. Menu is both in English and Vietnamese so it was really informative. \n\nAbout the price: It is quite more expensive than some local restaurants that I have tried, maybe because its location is in central Saigon. \n\nOverall, one try is okay but never come back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 15, 2018",
